msgid "Straight answers about what this tool touches, what it can’t, and how to check us for yourself - not legal boilerplate. The short version: the desktop app only ever <em>reads</em> your running game, the web app runs entirely in your browser, and we can’t promise this is ban-safe - so use it at your own risk."
